# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CaseVault: case data must NEVER be committed.
# The app code lives in this repo; case data lives only on the SSD.
# scripts/check-no-case-data.sh enforces this in CI as well, in case
# something is ever force-added past these rules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The data and AI folders from the SSD, wherever they end up
CaseVault-Data/
CaseVault-AI/
CV-AI/
cases/
backups/
checks/

# Vault files by name, anywhere in the tree
vault.json
case.json
timeline.json
notes.md
*-check.json

# Case documents and evidence (the app itself only ships the icons below)
*.[pP][dD][fF]
*.[dD][oO][cC]
*.[dD][oO][cC][xX]
*.[rR][tT][fF]
*.[oO][dD][tT]
*.[xX][lL][sS]
*.[xX][lL][sS][xX]
*.[cC][sS][vV]
*.[pP][pP][tT]
*.[pP][pP][tT][xX]
*.[mM][sS][gG]
*.[eE][mM][lL]
*.[pP][sS][tT]
*.[tT][xX][tT]
*.[jJ][pP][gG]
*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
*.[pP][nN][gG]
*.[gG][iI][fF]
*.[bB][mM][pP]
*.[tT][iI][fF]
*.[tT][iI][fF][fF]
*.[hH][eE][iI][cC]
*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]
*.[mM][pP]3
*.[mM]4[aA]
*.[wW][aA][vV]
*.[mM][pP]4
*.[mM][oO][vV]
*.[aA][vV][iI]
*.[zZ][iI][pP]
*.7[zZ]
*.[rR][aA][rR]
!icons/*.png
# Third-party library license files bundled in v1.5
!vendor/**/*.[tT][xX][tT]

# AI models and the portable Ollama build (these live on the CV-AI partition)
models/
ollama/
*.[gG][gG][uU][fF]
*.[sS][aA][fF][eE][tT][eE][nN][sS][oO][rR][sS]
*.[bB][iI][nN]

# Secrets and local settings
.env
.env.*
*.[kK][eE][yY]
*.[pP][eE][mM]
*.[bB][eE][kK]

# OS and editor clutter
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/
System Volume Information/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.[sS][wW][pP]
node_modules/
